^XPD(9.6,13451,1,1,0)="This patch addresses two issues:"
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,3,0)="1. The entry for ""TRIMETHOPRIM/SULFAMETHOXAZOLE"" is incorrectly spelled as"
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,4,0)="   ""TRIMETHAPRIM/SULFAMETHOXAZOLE"" in the ORGANISM SUB-FIELD FILE (#63.3) "
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,5,0)="   file as well as in the ANTIMICROBIAL SUSCEPTIBILITY (#62.06) file."
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,6,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,7,0)="2. The Lookup Accession report will show an inaccurate status for a panel "
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,8,0)="   if the full accession is specified and if the panel was not partially"
^XPD(9.6,13451,1,9,0)="   verified on the original accession date."
