^XPD(9.6,13474,1,1,0)="The patch addresses one (1) issue: "
^XPD(9.6,13474,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13474,1,3,0)="1.      The Suspense Processing [RMPR SUSP MENU] option may show records "
