^XPD(9.6,13481,1,0)="^^9^9^3230824^"
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,1,0)="Patch EC*2.0*163 inactivates any DSS UNIT (#724) file record with the SEND"
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,2,0)="TO PCE (#13) field set to 'Send No Records' and have an inactive/invalid"
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,3,0)="Stop Code."
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,4,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,5,0)="This patch is being released along with patch SD*5.3*856, that provides"
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,6,0)="Fiscal Year 2024 updates to the CLINIC STOP (#40.7) file. When"
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,7,0)="inactivating stop codes in CLINIC STOP (#40.7) file, the DSS UNIT (#724) "
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,8,0)="file also needs to be updated. Patch SD*5.3*856 will need to be installed"
^XPD(9.6,13481,1,9,0)="prior to patch EC*2.0*163."
