^XPD(9.6,13503,1,6,0)="VSE-5499: AP - VistA: Retire RPCs 90 days post release of patch 845"
^XPD(9.6,13503,1,7,0)="VSE-5823: MD - Update SDBUILD to have default values for auto rebook, "
