^XPD(9.6,13504,1,1,0)="This patch will resolve the following issues:"
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,3,0)="Several sites have reported that when editing a verified invoice by "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,4,0)="changing a non-controlled substance drug to a controlled substance drug a "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,5,0)="negative balance for the non-controlled drug is appearing on the "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,6,0)="Controlled Substance Inventory Sheet. Another defect experienced with "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,7,0)="this same type of edit is the inability to select the non-controlled "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,8,0)="substance drug by name when trying to adjust the negative balance in the "
^XPD(9.6,13504,1,9,0)="controlled substance vault."
