^XPD(9.6,13529,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13529,1,3,0)="INC27716753 - Due to an incorrect API call to retrieve ICD codes (fixed in"
^XPD(9.6,13529,1,4,0)="RMPR*213), some records associated with the Form 2319 may contain the ""-1"""
^XPD(9.6,13529,1,5,0)="error code in the SUSPENSE ICD field of the RECORD OF PROS APPLIANCE/ "
^XPD(9.6,13529,1,6,0)="REPAIR file (#660)."
