^XPD(9.6,13532,0)="DVBA*2.7*250^93^0^3231025^y"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,0)="^^26^26^3231005^"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,1,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*250 will implement the following:"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,2,0)="1. Enhancements to the CAPRI News Feed to call the SharePoint "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,3,0)="   application and launch Pdf's with the CAPRI GUI, no longer launching an"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,4,0)="   external browser."
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,5,0)="2. Enhance transmission error handling to save the encoded XML in a "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,6,0)="   VistA file and allow users to resend, while maintaining a logged"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,7,0)="   sender, response codes received and an attempted transmission count."
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,8,0)="   a. VistA CAPRI TEMPLATES FILE (#396.17) has been modified to store"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,9,0)="      transmission metrics for transmission processes."
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,10,0)="3. Short term fix for a Kernel issue for users with duplicate VistA "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,11,0)="   New Person accounts and missing social security numbers."
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,12,0)="4. Pseudo SSN was not working properly within the CAPRI GUI "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,13,0)="   application, this internal issue was found and corrected."
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,14,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,15,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,16,0)="Patch DVBA*2.7*250 will also address the following bugs:"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,17,0)="INC24303017: Edit Fields Not Announced by Screen Reader"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,18,0)="INC23768900: CAPRI Application Error Resulting in Shut Down"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,19,0)="INC25976939: CAPRI copy/paste and tab malfunction when entering a new "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,20,0)="             patient"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,21,0)="INC24797102: HRC - Eu is having issues with the CAPRI Fayetteville "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,22,0)="             location whenever EU's want to place an order"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,23,0)="INC21249123: CAPRI 2507 rerouted from Muskogee VAMC to Cheyenne VAMC was "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,24,0)="             not delivered to Cheyenne VAMC"
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,25,0)="INC26557317: Connection to server for DVBAB REPORT 7131INQ could not be "
^XPD(9.6,13532,1,26,0)="             established"
^XPD(9.6,13532,4,0)="^9.64PA^396.17^1"
^XPD(9.6,13532,4,396.17,0)=396.17
