^XPD(9.6,13540,0)="GMTS*2.7*145^42^0^3231004^y"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,0)="^^12^12^3230214^"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,1,0)="This patch addresses the following issues:"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,3,0)="1. With the introduction of PARK functionality (CPRS 32B release), and"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,4,0)="once the Park functionality is enabled, the Health Summary Type of"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,5,0)="Essential Med List for Review needs to be able to display ""Active/Parked"""
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,6,0)="as a status. These changes in Health Summary routines, along with changes"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,7,0)="in patch PSO*7.0*712, will allow the Essential Med List for Review to be"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,8,0)="able to display ""Active/Parked"" when the prescription is in a Parked "
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,9,0)="status."
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,10,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,11,0)="2. INC18892605: Essential Med List, Non-VA medications instructions print"
^XPD(9.6,13540,1,12,0)="the old directions first and the new directions second."
^XPD(9.6,13540,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
