^XPD(9.6,13559,1,1,0)="The patch addresses one (1) issue: "
^XPD(9.6,13559,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13559,1,3,0)="Under certain circumstances, the CVD REPAIR/OBSTRUCT field (#521) value "
^XPD(9.6,13559,1,4,0)="in the SURGERY File (#130) is not displaying/printing for a NON-CARDIAC "
^XPD(9.6,13559,1,5,0)="RISK ASSESSMENT using the ""Print a Surgery Risk Assessment"" [SROA PRINT "
^XPD(9.6,13559,1,6,0)="ASSESSMENT] option."
^XPD(9.6,13559,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
