^XPD(9.6,13560,1,346,0)="10. New action View History Log (HL)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,347,0)="   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,348,0)="   This new action added eRx Holding Queue Display screen will allow the user"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,349,0)="   to view a comprehensive history of the eRx as it moves through the OP"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,350,0)="   application, including activities in Backdoor Pharmacy. Please, refer to"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,351,0)="   the user documentation for more information about this new option."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,352,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,353,0)="11. Batch Hold and Un-Hold Functionality"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,354,0)="   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,355,0)="   The current Hold and Un-Hold actions were modified to perform the following "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,356,0)="   additional function: every time a prescription is put on Hold or removed"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,357,0)="   from Hold, the software will check other prescriptions exist for that"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,358,0)="   patient that were sent by the same prescriber on the same day. If any is"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,359,0)="   found, the software will ask the user if they want to Hold (or Un-Hold)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,360,0)="   those additional eRx records as well, as shown below:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,361,0)="    ..."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,362,0)="    Select Action: Next Screen// H   Hold  "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,363,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,364,0)="    Select HOLD reason code: HAL       NO ALLERGY ASSESSMENT"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,365,0)="    Additional Comments (Optional): TESTING BATCH HOLD"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,366,0)="    Updating...done."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,367,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,368,0)="    The following prescriptions are from the same provider and received on the"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,369,0)="    same day:"
