^XPD(9.6,13560,1,381,0)="12. New Allergy Functionality Enhancements"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,382,0)="   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,383,0)="   Functionality related allergies is being improved through the following"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,384,0)="   modifications:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,385,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,386,0)="   a) When matching or accepting validation of a VistA patient it will display"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,387,0)="      in the warnings if the VistA patient selected has no Allergy Assessment:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,388,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,389,0)="      *******************************   WARNING(S)  *************************"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,390,0)="      VistA Patient does not have an Allergy Assessment."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,391,0)="      ***********************************************************************"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,392,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,393,0)="      MbM sites only:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,394,0)="      -------------- "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,395,0)="        i) User won't be able to accept validation of a VistA Patient that"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,396,0)="           does not have an Allergy Assessment."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,397,0)="       ii) All the actionable records for the same eRx patient will be"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,398,0)="           automatically be put on Hold with the code HAL - NO ALLERGY"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,399,0)="           ASSESSMENT, the user will be notified as shown below:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,400,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,401,0)="     The following eRx record(s) have been put on Hold (HAL) because the "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,402,0)="     VistA Patient selected (OUTPATIENT,JLG ONE) does not have an Allergy"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,403,0)="     Assessment:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,404,0)="     ERX ID     DRUG NAME                      PROVIDER            STATUS"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,405,0)="     -----------------------------------------------------------------------"
