^XPD(9.6,13560,1,411,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,412,0)="     Type <Enter> to continue or '^' to exit: "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,413,0)="  "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,414,0)="   b) A new screen titled 'Patient Allergies' was created to show the eRx"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,415,0)="      Patient allergies side-by-side with the VistA Patient allergies in"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,416,0)="      detail. This new Screen can be invoked by using the PA (Patient"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,417,0)="      Allergy) hidden action from the following screens:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,418,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,419,0)="         - eRx Holding Queue Display Screen (eRx Holding Queue)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,420,0)="         - Patient Validation Screen (eRx Holding Queue)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,421,0)="         - Drug Validation Screen (eRx Holding Queue)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,422,0)="         - Pending Order Orders Screen (Backdoor OP)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,423,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,424,0)="      This new screen contains an action called VPA (VistA Patient Allergies),"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,425,0)="      which allows the user to update the VistA Patient Allegies without "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,426,0)="      leaving the option. "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,427,0)="      Note: In order to use the VPA action the VistA Patient has to have been"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,428,0)="            previously matched."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,429,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,430,0)="13.New Eligibility Functionality (MbM sites only)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,431,0)="   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,432,0)="   Functionality related ChampVA Rx Benefit Eligibility is being improved"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,433,0)="   through the following modifications:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,434,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,435,0)="   a) ChampVA Rx Benefit eligibility information will be displayed in the new"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,436,0)="      Patient Validation Screen in the Header section. It will have one of "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,437,0)="      these 3 possible Values: ELIGIBLE, NOT ELIGIBLE or SB (Spine Bifida)."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,438,0)="   b) When matching a VistA patient it will display in the warnings if the"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,439,0)="      VistA patient selected is not eligible for ChampVA Rx Benefit (soft-"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,440,0)="      stop):"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,441,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,442,0)="      *******************************   WARNING(S)  *************************"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,443,0)="      VistA Patient is not eligible for ChampVA Rx Benefit."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,444,0)="      ***********************************************************************"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,445,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,446,0)="   c) It will not allow accepting validation of a matched VistA patient that"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,447,0)="      is not eligible for ChampVA Rx Benefit (hard-stop):"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,448,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,449,0)="      *******************************INVALID PATIENT*************************"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,450,0)="      VistA Patient is not eligible for ChampVA Rx Benefit."
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,451,0)="      ***********************************************************************"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,452,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,453,0)="   d) When matching or accepting validation fo a VistA patient that is not"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,454,0)="      eligible for ChampVA Rx Benefit all the actionable records for the same"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,455,0)="      eRx patient will be automatically be put on Hold with the code HEL - "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,456,0)="      ELIGIBILITY ISSUES, the user will be notified as shown below:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,457,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,458,0)="     The following eRx record(s) have been put on Hold (HEL) because the "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,459,0)="     VistA Patient selected (OUTPATIENT,JLG ONE) is not Eligible for ChampVA"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,460,0)="     Rx Benefit:"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,461,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,462,0)="     ERX ID     DRUG NAME                      PROVIDER            STATUS"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,463,0)="     -----------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,464,0)="     123010     CETIRIZINE HCL 10MG TAB        TEST,PROVIDER        HEL"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,465,0)="     123011     GABAPENTIN 300MG CAP           TEST,PROVIDER        HEL"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,466,0)="     123012     CITALOPRAM HYDROBROMIDE 20MG T TEST,PROVIDER        HEL"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,467,0)="     123013     IBUPROFEN 400MG TAB            TEST,PROVIDER        HEL"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,468,0)="     123014     ACETAMINOPHEN 325MG TAB        TEST,PROVIDER        HEL"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,469,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,470,0)="     Type <Enter> to continue or '^' to exit: "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,471,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,472,0)="14.Duplicate VistA Patient Check (MbM sites only)"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,473,0)="   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,474,0)="   A new check will be performed when the users selects a patient (Edit) or"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,475,0)="   Accept Validation of a previously selected patient. The software will check"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,476,0)="   whether potential duplicate VistA patients exist and if so it will warn the"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,477,0)="   user about it, as seen below (Patient Validation Screen):"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,478,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,479,0)="   Edit Patient (Soft Stop):"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,480,0)="   ------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,481,0)="    ...  "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,482,0)="    P   Print                 H   Hold                  UH  Un Hold"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,483,0)="    E   Edit                  AV  Accept Validation     RJ  Reject"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,484,0)="    Select Item(s): Edit// e   Edit  "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,485,0)="    "
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,486,0)="    VISTA PATIENT: PHWWDY,QLYJH H"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,487,0)="       1   PHWWDY,QLYJH H      01/31/1952  101021512  TOMBSTONE,ID"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,488,0)="       2   PHWWDY,QLYJH H      09/30/1930  101097105  CASA GRANDA,FL"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,489,0)="       3   PHWWDY,QLYJH H      05/04/1934  101068053  SHADY GROVE,DE"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,490,0)="    CHOOSE 1-3: 1  PHWWDY,QLYJH H      01/31/1952  101021512  TOMBSTONE,ID"
^XPD(9.6,13560,1,491,0)="     Enrollment Priority:            Category: IN PROCESS    End Date: "
