^XPD(9.6,13629,1,1,0)="Computerized Patient Record System (CPRS) v33 MOE will address NSR "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,2,0)="20090602: Addition of a Function to Enter Stop and Start Dates for "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,3,0)="Inpatient Medications in CPRS."
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,4,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,5,0)="This patch is the preparation patch for the installation of CPRS v33 MOE. "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,6,0)="It gives pharmacy informatics the ability to define one-time "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,7,0)="administration schedules that should be excluded from the Start/Stop "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,8,0)="functionality in CPRS. The exclusion schedules can be defined at system "
^XPD(9.6,13629,1,9,0)="or division level."
