^XPD(9.6,13631,1,1,0)="This patch will resolve the following issue:"
^XPD(9.6,13631,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13631,1,3,0)="An error is preventing users from finishing pending CPRS orders on VistA "
^XPD(9.6,13631,1,4,0)="when utilizing option 'Complete Orders from OERR' (PSO LMOE FINISH)."
^XPD(9.6,13631,1,5,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13631,1,6,0)="The error occurs when the user selects controlled substances as a "
^XPD(9.6,13631,1,7,0)="secondary filter along with one of the schedule options."
