^XPD(9.6,13670,1,1,0)="This patch will address the following issue: "
^XPD(9.6,13670,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13670,1,3,0)="It was reported that when a provider ordered acetaminophen IV and then"
^XPD(9.6,13670,1,4,0)="ordered PO, a duplicate drug therapy alert did not populate (HITPS-10794)."
