^XPD(9.6,13671,1,1,0)="This patch addresses three issues:"
^XPD(9.6,13671,1,2,0)="1. IV order admin time editing not going to CPRS."
^XPD(9.6,13671,1,3,0)="2. Add new override reason."
^XPD(9.6,13671,1,4,0)="3. Corrected the spelling of 'UDPATE' to 'UPDATE' in the parameter 'ORWPCE"
^XPD(9.6,13671,1,5,0)="ASK ENCOUNTER UPDATE' in the field 'VALUE TERM'."
^XPD(9.6,13671,1,6,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13671,1,7,0)="For additional information, please see the patch description."
