^XPD(9.6,13685,1,0)="^^7^7^3231128^"
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,1,0)="Patch DG*5.3*1113 addresses an issue where certain PRF Flag Assignment"
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,2,0)="updates did not store the Created By Site (.09) field of the PRF"
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,3,0)="Assignment History (#26.14) file after the release of patch DG*5.3*1078."
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,4,0)="This patch will correct any records with a null value after the install of"
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,5,0)="patch DG*5.3*1078. This patch also stores the site ID for any other"
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,6,0)="locations that stores a PRF Assignment History (#26.14) update within the"
^XPD(9.6,13685,1,7,0)="Registration software."
