^XPD(9.6,13689,1,1,0)="The Application Programmer Interface (API PSOVCCA) used by CRM/VSE for"
^XPD(9.6,13689,1,2,0)="refilling a prescription, there is a rare possibility that the "
^XPD(9.6,13689,1,3,0)="prescription may be locked in VistA, which means updates aren't "
^XPD(9.6,13689,1,4,0)="permitted at that time. This is not properly communicated back to the"
^XPD(9.6,13689,1,5,0)="calling program. This patch will now return ""-8 - Prescription unavailable"
^XPD(9.6,13689,1,6,0)="- try again later""."
