^XPD(9.6,13727,1,1,0)="The Inbound Electronic Prescribing (eRx) Phase 2 Enhancements delivered in this"
^XPD(9.6,13727,1,2,0)="patch is a continuation effort to convert all of the MbM Class 3 modifications"
^XPD(9.6,13727,1,3,0)="into Class 1. Below is a summary of the changes being delivered in this patch."
^XPD(9.6,13727,1,4,0)="For a more comprehensive description of the changes please refer to the"
^XPD(9.6,13727,1,5,0)="documents listed in the Documentation section of this description.  "
