^XPD(9.6,13729,1,0)="^^6^6^3240506^"
^XPD(9.6,13729,1,1,0)="The Purpose of this patch is to address VIA OR Consult Error. This is "
^XPD(9.6,13729,1,2,0)="error is causing VistA to crash. The error is due to improper use of the "
^XPD(9.6,13729,1,3,0)="consult Remote procedure (RPC) by not passing a Patient record number "
^XPD(9.6,13729,1,4,0)="DFN. Without a DFN the program crashes causing errors in VistA. This "
^XPD(9.6,13729,1,5,0)="error is being called when the consult tab is being shown when a patient "
^XPD(9.6,13729,1,6,0)="isn't selected. It will tell the use that they are missing DFN"
^XPD(9.6,13729,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
