^XPD(9.6,13731,0)="LR*5.2*569^14^0^3240222^y"
^XPD(9.6,13731,1,0)="^^8^8^3231222^"
^XPD(9.6,13731,1,1,0)="Multidivisional sites have requested the ability to fine-tune the list of "
^XPD(9.6,13731,1,2,0)="orderable lab tests displayed to a user. This patch adds a flag field to "
^XPD(9.6,13731,1,3,0)="the ACCESSION AREA multiple-valued field (#6) in the LABORATORY TEST file "
^XPD(9.6,13731,1,4,0)="(#60) that when set for an accession area at a site, will block users "
^XPD(9.6,13731,1,5,0)="signed in to that site from seeing that test in the list of orderable "
