^XPD(9.6,13732,1,1,0)="Multidivisional sites have requested that the list of lab tests shown in "
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,2,0)="the Lab Test and Anatomic Pathology order dialogs is filtered. After "
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,3,0)="installation of this patch, tests that are associated with one or more "
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,4,0)="institutions/divisions are only shown to users who are logged in to one "
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,5,0)="of those institutions/divisions. This will prevent users from ordering a "
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,6,0)="test that cannot be processed at their local facility."
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,7,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13732,1,8,0)="Refer to the patch description for full details."
