^XPD(9.6,13743,0)="LR*5.2*566^14^0^3240513^y"
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,0)="^^10^10^3240215^^"
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,1,0)="This patch addresses three issues:"
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,2,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,3,0)="1. The status in CPRS might be incorrect for one or more tests if"
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,4,0)="   accessions were merged."
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,5,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,6,0)="2. The Incomplete test status report (LRWRKINC) might display inaccurate "
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,7,0)="   information if the user specified a past date instead of today."
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,8,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,9,0)="3. When merging is performed on an Emergency Room patient's accessions "
^XPD(9.6,13743,1,10,0)="   which contain at least one profile, an error might occur."
^XPD(9.6,13743,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
