^XPD(9.6,13761,1,4,0)="inactivated drug for outpatient."
^XPD(9.6,13761,1,5,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13761,1,6,0)="2. In CPRS, Lab Overview, Pending Lab Orders, and Lab Orders (All) Exceed "
^XPD(9.6,13761,1,7,0)="Max Occurrence Limit."
