^XPD(9.6,13887,1,1,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,13887,1,2,0)="EEO patch EEO*2*12 will mark all EEO Complaint Tracking Options "
^XPD(9.6,13887,1,3,0)="out of order with the following message: "
^XPD(9.6,13887,1,4,0)="""Diabled-use EEO Eco-Case Management System (eSquared CSM)"". "
^XPD(9.6,13887,1,5,0)="It will also dequeue the EEO TASKED BULLETIN option which transmits"
^XPD(9.6,13887,1,6,0)="formal complaints marked for transmission."
