^XPD(9.6,13913,1,0)="^^6^6^3240822^"
^XPD(9.6,13913,1,1,0)="This patch fixes some issues found with the TaskMan Sync Flag "
^XPD(9.6,13913,1,2,0)="functionality.  A bug has been found with the XUTM SYNC option where the "
^XPD(9.6,13913,1,3,0)="calls that pass Sync Flag and the ZIO are flipped, thus not working as"
^XPD(9.6,13913,1,4,0)="intended.  Also, an overall analysis of the Sync Flag functionality"
^XPD(9.6,13913,1,5,0)="throughout TaskMan is being done to see if other bugs exist that hinder"
^XPD(9.6,13913,1,6,0)="its use."
