^XPD(9.6,14006,1,1,0)="IFCAP-GIP Users are currently prompted to respond to Federal Procurement"
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,2,0)="Data System (FPDS) questions during order entry. However, answers have not"
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,3,0)="been sent to the Austin Accounting Center (AAC) since the interface was "
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,4,0)="shutdown via IFCAP patch PRC*5.1*220 (STOP FPDS MESSAGE TRANSMISSION) "
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,5,0)="that was nationally released in July 2021. "
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,6,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,7,0)="Supply chain users are prompted to provide responses to FPDS, this patch"
^XPD(9.6,14006,1,8,0)="is removing the FPDS questions."
^XPD(9.6,14006,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
