^XPD(9.6,14010,1,3,0)="VSE-8255:  TB - VistA: Create a new SDES2 RPC in order to support VAOS"
^XPD(9.6,14010,1,4,0)="VSE-10012: TW - VistA: Modify SDES2 EDIT CLINIC to allow for LOA decrease"
