^XPD(9.6,14011,0)="CDSP*1.0*1^242^0^3250409^y"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,0)="^9.61A^41^41^3250408^^^^"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,1,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform is the core system to power Clinical"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,2,0)="Decision Support (CDS) applications. This platform enables rapid"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,3,0)="development and deployment of applications that follow Substitutable"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,4,0)="Medical Applications and Reusable Technologies (SMART) family of "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,5,0)="standards such as SMART on FHIR (Fast Healthcare Interoperability"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,6,0)="Resources) and CDS Hooks. CDSP facilitates the launch of CDS applications"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,7,0)="from within the VA Electronic Health Record (EHR) - CPRS and Clinical"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,8,0)="Context Management (CCOW) vault patient context synchronization. The"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,9,0)="system encompasses technical infrastructure and shared capabilities to"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,10,0)="interact with electronic health record data, as well as specific"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,11,0)="applications providing clinical decision support such as Covid-19 Patient"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,12,0)="Manager (CPM), Lung Cancer Screening Platform (LCSPv2)."
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,13,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,14,0)="This patch will distribute an updated Option CDSP RPC CONTEXT. The OPTION "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,15,0)="CDSP RPC CONTEXT contains additional RPCs, all of which have new approved "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,16,0)="Integration Agreements.These additional RPCs will enable new Applications"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,17,0)="to be launched from the Clinical Decision Support Platform as listed below."
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,18,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,19,0)="Lung Cancer Screening Pv2: TIU CREATE RECORD Text Integration Utility and "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,20,0)="PXRPC SAVE2 Patient Care Encounter. These RPCs will give the Lung Cancer"
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,21,0)="Screening App the ability to create TIU Documents that document actions "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,22,0)="taken during a LCSPv2 encounter."
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,23,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,24,0)="Precision Oncology: ORWPT LIST ALL Order Entry Results Reporting. Get and "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,25,0)="filter list of patients. This RPC returns a set of patient names for use "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,26,0)="with a long list box for selection by the user."
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,27,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,28,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform: VPR GET PATIENT DATA JSON Virtual "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,29,0)="Patient Record. This RPC will be added to supports APPs such as Lung "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,30,0)="Cancer Screening and Precision Oncology. The RPC is to be used as an "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,31,0)="alternative to VPR GET PATIENT DATA, which returns data in XML.  There "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,32,0)="are frameworks identified where XML libraries often have vulnerabilities "
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,33,0)="(expat and friends) and deserializing XML is more difficult than JSON."
^XPD(9.6,14011,1,34,0)=" "
