^XPD(9.6,14019,1,511,0)="10. RxRenewalResponse Message Types under SQ"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,512,0)="   ---------------------------------------------------------------------------"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,513,0)="   The search query option MESSAGE TYPE has been modified. Upon entering"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,514,0)="   certain message types (RE and CX) as listed below, the user will be"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,515,0)="   prompted to enter the corresponding RESPONSE TYPE as indicated. In this"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,516,0)="   prompt, users have the option to choose ALL to view all response types for"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,517,0)="   the message type selected or select a specific response type as shown below."
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,518,0)="   For additional details on this new change, please refer to the user manual"
^XPD(9.6,14019,1,519,0)="   documentation."
