^XPD(9.6,14042,0)="IB*2.0*769^49^0^3250605^y"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,0)="^^8^8^3250530^"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,1,0)="Utilizing the existing infrastructure put into place with"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,2,0)="IB*2.0*704, this patch facilitates the exchange of Copay Information"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,3,0)="between existing copay interfaces within Vista that will be"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,4,0)="synchronized to create a bi-directional integrated Copay Accumulators"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,5,0)="platform with Oracle.  Previously this interface utilized Data Access"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,6,0)="Service (DAS) as the middleware, but updates will be made to use Veterans"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,7,0)="Data Integration and Federation (VDIF) to facilitate the communication"
^XPD(9.6,14042,1,8,0)="between VistA and Oracle Health. "
