^XPD(9.6,14060,1,0)="^^9^9^3250723^"
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,1,0)="When reviewing a New Purchase Order, the total cost is being shown in the "
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,2,0)="header section as 0.00 instead of the correct total cost. This patch "
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,3,0)="corrects this to ensure the total cost is correctly displayed in the "
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,4,0)="header."
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,5,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,6,0)="Apply code to the PRCHNPO1 routine to set the global ^PRC(442,,0) 15th "
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,7,0)="piece to the total cost value before the final FileMan DIE call to various"
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,8,0)="templates and DR strings, ensuring the correct value is displayed"
^XPD(9.6,14060,1,9,0)="regardless of the branching."
^XPD(9.6,14060,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
