^XPD(9.6,14072,1,0)="^^8^8^3250730^"
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,1,0)="This patch updates Evaluation and Management codes in the TYPE OF VISIT"
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,2,0)="file (#357.69).  These codes are a subset of the Current Procedural"
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,3,0)="Terminology codes published by the American Medical Association and they"
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,4,0)="are used to describe the level of care for an outpatient visit."
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,5,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,6,0)="In addition, an enhancement will be made to default in the CPT short name"
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,7,0)="instead of the Recommended Header/Text when adding Type of Visit codes to"
^XPD(9.6,14072,1,8,0)="a Visit Type selection list within an encounter form."
