^XPD(9.6,14105,0)="IB*2.0*828^49^0^3250725^y"
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,0)="^^19^19^3250723^"
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,1,0)="After patch IB*2.0*796 was released users noticed that while using the "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,2,0)="Claims tracking Editor processes"
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,3,0)=", the posting of answers to two questions were not being posted as they "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,4,0)="did before the patch when a user "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,5,0)="entered the comments option of the Claims Tracking page and returned to "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,6,0)="do other steps.  When they return "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,7,0)="to the main screen their answers were not displayed to show them their "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,8,0)="entry stayed posted. The answers were only posted after extras steps were "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,9,0)="taken to display the results."
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,10,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,11,0)="First After the user entered comments in the ""Billing Info Edit"" option. "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,12,0)="then returned and ran the View/Edit Episode option. Then"
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,13,0)="""Review Info"" option. Changed the ""TRACKED AS RANDOM SAMPLE?: NO// "" to "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,14,0)="yes or no. If they changed to ""YES"" then and ""R"" should show in the ""UR"" "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,15,0)="column by the item selected for Reviewed. "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,16,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,17,0)="Second after the user added comments then returned to add reason not "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,18,0)="billable the ""BILL"" column should display ""YES"" or ""NO"" but did not until "
^XPD(9.6,14105,1,19,0)="extra steps are performed to verify their action was recorded."
^XPD(9.6,14105,4,0)="^9.64PA^^"
^XPD(9.6,14105,6)="^759"
