^XPD(9.6,14106,1,1,0)="Patients not displaying on the ""IB MT REV PEND CHARGES       Release "
^XPD(9.6,14106,1,2,0)="Charges 'Pending Review""  option list as expected. When the previous "
^XPD(9.6,14106,1,3,0)="primary means test on file is marked the patient does not AGREE TO PAY "
