^XPD(9.6,14128,0)="CDSP*1.0*2^242^0^3250902^y"
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,0)="31^9.61A^31^31^3250828^^^"
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,1,0)="This patch will install additional necessary components to support the "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,2,0)="Clinical Decision Support Platform (CDSP).  "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,3,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,4,0)="CDSP is the core system to power Clinical Decision Support (CDS) "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,5,0)="applications. This platform enables rapid development and deployment of "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,6,0)="applications that follow Substitutable Medical Applications and Reusable "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,7,0)="Technologies (SMART) family of standards such as SMART on FHIR (Fast "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,8,0)="Healthcare  "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,9,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,10,0)="Interoperability Resources) and CDS Hooks. CDSP facilitates the launch of "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,11,0)="CDS applications from within the VA Electronic Health Record (EHR) - "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,12,0)="CPRS. The CDS Platform also relies on the Clinical Context Management "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,13,0)="(CCOW) vault to carry patient context and the synchronization of the "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,14,0)="selected patient between CPRS and the CDS Platform and thus CDS App "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,15,0)="launched from the CDS Platform. The system encompasses technical "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,16,0)="infrastructure and shared capabilities to interact with electronic health "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,17,0)="record data, as well as specific applications providing clinical decision "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,18,0)="support such as Covid-19 Patient Manager (CPM), Lung Cancer Screening "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,19,0)="Risk Calculator.  "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,20,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,21,0)="The CDSP RPC CONTEXT menu option contains the following RPCs. The RPCs "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,22,0)="added with this patch are listed below with the Integration Control"
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,23,0)="Agreement number."
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,24,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,25,0)="Added with CDSP*1.0*2 "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,26,0)="1635:  TIU GET RECORD TEXT "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,27,0)="3954:  TIU SET DOCUMENT TEXT "
^XPD(9.6,14128,1,28,0)="1790:  TIU SIGN RECORD "
