^XPD(9.6,14161,1,0)="^^10^10^3260121^"
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,1,0)="The purpose of this patch is to update the DENTAL CPT CODE MAPPING  "
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,2,0)="(#228) file to comply with the changes introduced for Fiscal Year "
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,3,0)="(FY) 26, Quarter (Q) 1."
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,4,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,5,0)="The patch also updates Coding Standards as approved by the Office of"
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,6,0)="Dentistry."
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,7,0)=" "
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,8,0)="A Mailman message will be sent to DENTV ADA CODE MAPPING mail group to"
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,9,0)="identify new and modified ADA/CPT codes at the site. The patch contains"
^XPD(9.6,14161,1,10,0)="a post-installation routine to perform the updates and notification."
^XPD(9.6,14161,4,0)="^9.64PA^228^1"
