^XPD(9.6,14222,1,1,0)="Routine EHMRXCP is used to automatically discontinue prescriptions from"
^XPD(9.6,14222,1,2,0)="the VistA database upon successful migration to the Cerner Millennium "
^XPD(9.6,14222,1,3,0)="Electronic Health Record. This ensures that only one active instance of a "
^XPD(9.6,14222,1,4,0)="prescription exists in the two systems."
