^XPD(9.6,14259,1,1,0)="This patch addresses two issues in inpatient med orders."
^XPD(9.6,14259,1,2,0)="When editing and then accepting a pending complex order:"
^XPD(9.6,14259,1,3,0)="  1)  Special Instructions are being lost, replaced with ""too long..."""
^XPD(9.6,14259,1,4,0)="  2)  Indication field is being deleted."
^XPD(9.6,14259,1,5,0)="This project corrects both of these issues, maintaining"
^XPD(9.6,14259,1,6,0)="the required data after editing the pending order."
